    "A profile named '%@' already exists." : {

    },
    "A Profile node bound to another Workflow profile — it runs that workflow's canvas as a child. Text-only handoff: the child gets this node's input as its message; variables and artifacts do not cross in (artifacts produced inside do flow out). Nesting is limited to 3 levels and cycles are blocked at design time." : {

    },
    "A run is attended when you start it from the app; it is unattended when the scheduler or a chat bridge (Telegram / Discord / Slack) starts it. Anything that waits for a human behaves differently:" : {
      "comment" : "A run is attended when you start it from the app; it is unattended when the scheduler or a chat bridge (Telegram / Discord / Slack) starts it. Anything that waits for a human behaves differently:",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "A run of typing in one inspector field counts as a single step, so that is 25 edits, not 25 keystrokes. Pause for a few seconds, switch to another node, or make any structural change, and the next edit starts its own step." : {
      "comment" : "Text describing how a single edit in an inspector counts as a single step in a run.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "A run that works longer than this is stopped and marked Timed out. Time spent waiting for approval is not counted. Default uses the profile's execution timeout, or %@ if it has none." : {
