    },
    "A skill is a set of instructions an agent loads when a task matches its description." : {
      "comment" : "A description of what a skill is.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "A straightforward LLM interface without agentic capabilities." : {

    },
    "A Sub-workflow node has NO outer budget by default — its child canvas is already bounded, node by node, on its own terms. Setting its Per-Node Timeout adds a ceiling over the child's ENTIRE run (not one step); with retries configured, every attempt shares that ONE ceiling rather than each getting its own." : {
      "comment" : "Text describing a Sub-workflow node's budget.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "A terminal can succeed with empty text — for example an Action node whose job was a side effect. That's a valid outcome, not a failure." : {
